  "title" : "Choosing a pattern for interchangeable algorithms",
  "text" : "A billing service must pick between three tax-calculation algorithms at runtime, depending on the customer's country. The set of algorithms grows every year. Which design is the best fit?",
  "hint" : "Ask which part of the design varies, and how often a new case is added.",
  "points" : 1.0,
  "scoringType" : "ALL_OR_NOTHING",
  "randomizeOrder" : false,
